          "type": "prose",
          "text": "In orders.csv, the header supplies label and quantity keys. DictReader returns CSV field text, including numeric-looking quantity text. The managed body collects rows; the file is closed afterward. For text, read remaining contents or write text through the file object.",
          "role": "example",
          "lineage": {
            "concept_ids": [
              "python.file_io"
            ],
